# LMTP over TCP/IP, tls-on-connect (protocol = lmtps)
need_ipv4
#
# 1: the server talks TLS from the first octet, then LMTP; no STARTTLS
server -tls DIR/aux-fixed/cert1 DIR/aux-fixed/cert1 PORT_S
*starttls
220 ESMTP
LHLO
250-OK
250 HELP
MAIL FROM:
250 Sender OK
RCPT TO:
250 Receiver OK
DATA
354 Send it
.
250 OK
QUIT
250 OK
****
exim -odi userx
This is a test message.
****
